Package: ksystemstats-rpi5-fix
Version: 1.3.1
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: GamingTux <gamingtux@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: kde
Priority: optional
Depends: libcap2-bin, bash
Recommends: plasma-systemmonitor, ksystemstats
Provides: rpi5-kde-sensors-fix
Homepage: https://github.com/GamingTux/argon-oneup-suite
Description: KDE Plasma 6 Systemmonitor ksystemstats Fix for Raspberry Pi 5 / CM5
 Fixes KDE Plasma 6 Systemmonitor ksystemstats ARM64 /proc/cpuinfo deadlock
 (KDE Bug #493093) via private mount namespace and maps cpu_thermal to CPU cards.
 Includes ksystemstats-ns-helper binary, cpuinfo generator, and systemd service override.
